  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Grate carrot.\n• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67159c10ffa4e28ccb95b0ed-a88b9602.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, tossing, until browned, 3-4 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add sweet chilli sauce and a splash of water, tossing tofu to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67159c10ffa4e28ccb95b0ed-64be0603.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, combine carrot, mixed salad leaves, shredded cabbage mix, Japanese style dressing and the soy sauce. Season pepper and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67159c10ffa4e28ccb95b0ed-09096144.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Japanese-style salad between bowls.\n• Top with sweet chilli tofu and a dollop of garlic aioli.\n• Garnish with crunchy fried noodles and chilli (if using) to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67159c10ffa4e28ccb95b0ed-101c8ed2.jpeg"
    }
  ]
